@startuml
!theme plain
hide empty description
title Plugin lifecycle

[*] --> Uploaded
Uploaded --> Rejected : signature, digest or SDK range invalid (RN-203)
Uploaded --> AwaitingGrant : manifest valid
AwaitingGrant --> Migrating : capabilities granted (RN-205)
Migrating --> Installed : migrations applied (RN-207)
Migrating --> AwaitingGrant : migration failed, nothing changed
Installed --> Enabled : enable
Enabled --> Disabled : disable or repeated failures (RN-208, RN-209)
Disabled --> Enabled : enable
Enabled --> Upgrading : new version
Upgrading --> Enabled : migrated
Upgrading --> Enabled : failed, previous version kept
Disabled --> Removed : remove after confirmation (RN-210)
Rejected --> [*]
Removed --> [*]
@enduml
